<div class="alert alert-info">
    <div class="alert-icon">🔒</div>
    <div class="alert-content">
        <div class="alert-title">Action Required: Email Verification</div>
        <p class="message-secondary">Please verify your email address to access all features and secure your account.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<h1 class="greeting">Welcome to Vorkana, {{name}}!</h1>

<p class="message">
    Thank you for joining Vorkana, the professional network connecting talent with opportunity. 
    We're excited to have you as part of our community.
</p>

<div class="card">
    <h3 class="card-title">Complete Your Registration</h3>
    <p class="message mb-8">
        To protect your account and unlock all Vorkana features, please verify your email address by clicking the button below.
    </p>
    
    <div class="btn-center">
    <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" 
       target="_blank" 
       rel="noopener noreferrer"
       class="btn">
        {{buttonText}}
    </a>
</div>
</div>

<p class="message text-center">
    <strong>Or copy and paste this URL into your browser:</strong>
</p>

<div class="code-block">
    {{verificationUrl}}
</div>

<div class="alert alert-warning mt-8">
    <div class="alert-icon">⏰</div>
    <div class="alert-content">
        <div class="alert-title">Link Expiration Notice</div>
        <p class="message-secondary">
            This verification link expires in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>. 
            If it expires, you can request a new verification email from your account settings.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<h2 class="greeting" style="font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 24px;">What You Can Do After Verification</h2>

<div class="grid grid-2">
    <div class="card">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 12px;">💼</div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Create Professional Gigs</h3>
        <p class="message-secondary">Showcase your skills and services to clients worldwide.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; color: #3b82f6; margin-bottom: 12px;">🤝</div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Connect with Professionals</h3>
        <p class="message-secondary">Build your network and collaborate with industry experts.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; color: #8b5cf6; margin-bottom: 12px;">⭐</div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Build Your Reputation</h3>
        <p class="message-secondary">Earn reviews and ratings to establish credibility.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card">
        <div style="font-size: 24px; color: #f59e0b; margin-bottom: 12px;">📊</div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Access Analytics</h3>
        <p class="message-secondary">Track your performance and optimize your offerings.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-danger mt-8">
    <div class="alert-icon">⚠️</div>
    <div class="alert-content">
        <div class="alert-title">Security Notice</div>
        <p class="message-secondary">
            <strong>Didn't create this account?</strong> 
            If you didn't sign up for Vorkana, you can safely ignore this email. 
            The account will be automatically removed if not verified within {{expiresIn}}.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<p class="message text-center">
    Need assistance? Our support team is here to help.<br>
    Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #10b981; font-weight: 500;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
</p>